  subtitles:
  - timestamp: 0
    speakerName: Narrator
    dialogueText: You may proudly present your trophy on that shelf over there!
  - timestamp: 3.47
    speakerName: Narrator
    dialogueText: Now... off you go, and remember;
  - timestamp: 6.63
    speakerName: Narrator
    dialogueText: the real thing will be MUCH harder.
  - timestamp: 8.66
    speakerName: Narrator
    dialogueText: Do not let your guard down.
  - timestamp: 10.47
    speakerName: Narrator
    dialogueText: We wouldn't want any workplace casualties.
